  "description": "Fluent, strongly-typed bulk insert for SQL Server - map entity properties to columns with compile-checked lambdas and stream them straight into SqlBulkCopy, with no intermediate DataTable and no hand-written IDataReader.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
